    "host": "Lazy capability and exact checked origin; original native receiver; independently abortable two-second registration; twelve-second outer execution limit",
    "codec": "Unknown decoded once to native Tool.EmptyParams; checked Schema.toType advertises empty-record metadata; Toolkit owns JSON results, exact host owns fixed failure egress",
